#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gparted"
msgstr "Instalação do Gparted"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Gparted</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Gparted</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:95
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-doc    \\\n"
"            --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-doc    \\\n"
"            --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid "To run the tests, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para executar os testes, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:108
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-doc</parameter>: This switch disables building of the "
"optional documentation. Remove it if you have installed <application>GNOME "
"Doc Utils</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-doc</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a construção da "
"documentação opcional. Remova-a se você tiver instalado o <application>GNOME"
" Doc Utils</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-xhost-root</option>: This switch provides an interim "
"workaround to allow GParted to run under Wayland by using xhost to grant and"
" revoke root access to the X11 display."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-xhost-root</option>: Essa chave fornece uma solução "
"provisória para permitir que o GParted execute sob o Wayland usando xhost "
"para conceder e revogar acesso de root para a tela do X11."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid "Using Gparted"
msgstr "Usando o Gparted"

#. <xref linkend="ntfs-3g"/>
#. ,
#. <xref linkend="reiserfs"/>
#. ,
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To manipulate file systems Gparted has a run time dependency on various file"
" system tools (you only need to install the tools for file systems you "
"actually use): <xref linkend=\"hdparm\"/> (required for optionally "
"displaying serial number device information), <xref linkend=\"btrfs-"
"progs\"/>, <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dosfstools\"/>, e2fsprogs "
"(installed as part of LFS), <xref linkend=\"jfsutils\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"xfsprogs\"/>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://ftp.gnu.org/pub/gnu/mtools/\">mtools</ulink> (required to read"
" and write FAT16/32 volume labels and UUIDs), <ulink "
"url=\"ftp://ftp.mars.org/pub/hfs/\">hfsutils</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://packages.debian.org/sid/hfsprogs\">hfsprogs</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://nilfs.sourceforge.io/en/\">nilfs-utils</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://reiser4.wiki.kernel.org/index.php/Reiser4progs\"> "
"Reiser4progs</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url='https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/jeffm/reiserfsprogs/'>"
" reiserfsprogs</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Para manipular sistemas de arquivos, o Gparted tem uma dependência de tempo "
"de execução de várias ferramentas do sistema de arquivos (você somente "
"precisa instalar as ferramentas para os sistemas de arquivos que usa "
"atualmente): <xref linkend=\"hdparm\"/> (exigido para opcionalmente exibir "
"informações do número de série do dispositivo), <xref linkend=\"btrfs-progs\""
"/>, <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dosfstools\"/>, e2fsprogs (instalado "
"como parte do LFS), <xref linkend=\"jfsutils\"/>, <xref linkend=\"xfsprogs\"/"
">, <ulink url=\"https://ftp.gnu.org/pub/gnu/mtools/\">mtools</ulink> ("
"exigido para ler e escrever rótulos de volume e UUIDs de FAT16/32), <ulink "
"url=\"ftp://ftp.mars.org/pub/hfs/\">hfsutils</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https"
"://packages.debian.org/sid/hfsprogs\">hfsprogs</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https"
"://nilfs.sourceforge.io/en/\">nilfs-utils</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https"
"://reiser4.wiki.kernel.org/index.php/Reiser4progs\">Reiser4progs</ulink> e "
"<ulink url='https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/jeffm/"
"reiserfsprogs/'> reiserfsprogs</ulink>."

#. Another solution is to use <application>
#. pkexec</application>, from
#.       <xref linkend="polkit"/>, but some configuration is necessary.
#. Below, we
#.       describe these two alternatives: "ssh-askpass" and "pkexec".
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Root privileges are required to run Gparted. If you wish to run the "
"application from the menu, further applications and configurations are "
"necessary. Examples of applications that may be used: <ulink "
"url=\"https://people.debian.org/~kov/gksu/\">gksu</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://launchpad.net/kdesudo\">kdesudo</ulink>, or <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/tarakbumba/xdg-su\">xdg-su</ulink>.  Another simple"
" solution is <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Privilégios de root são exigidos para executar o Gparted. Se desejar "
"executar o aplicativo a partir do menu, outros aplicativos e configurações "
"serão necessários. Exemplos de aplicativos que podem ser usados: <ulink "
"url=\"https://people.debian.org/~kov/gksu/\">gksu</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://launchpad.net/kdesudo\">kdesudo</ulink> ou <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/tarakbumba/xdg-su\">xdg-su</ulink>. Outra solução "
"simples é <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid "ssh-askpass"
msgstr "ssh-askpass"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:178
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To optionally use <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/> if it is installed in your"
" system, run the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para usar opcionalmente o <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/> se ele estiver "
"instalado em teu sistema, execute os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a)"
" <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:183
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -v /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop.back &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i 's/Exec=/Exec=sudo -A /'               /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -v /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop.back &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i 's/Exec=/Exec=sudo -A /'               /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, clicking on the menu item for Gparted, a dialog appears on the screen, "
"asking for the administrator password."
msgstr ""
"Agora, clicando no item de menu para o Gparted, uma caixa de diálogo aparece"
" na tela solicitando a senha do(a) administrador(a)."

